DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261228T113000
DTSTAMP:20261126T220843Z
UID:hiller-293800@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Air Power Adventure\n\nExperience the amazing power of Earth
 ’s atmosphere in a spectacular science demonstration!\n\nAir may be invi
 sible\, but it can exert a tremendous force – enough to keep even the la
 rgest airplanes in the sky!  Explore the science of this invisible force 
 that is always around us as air power crushes metal\, powers chemical reac
 tions\, freezes metal and blasts objects skywards in a family-friendly dem
 onstration.\n\nEvent included with museum admission – no charge for Memb
 ers.\n\nUpcoming Dates\nSunday November 9\, 2025\nSunday December 7\, 2025
 \nFriday December 26\, 2025\n\nGet your tickets\n\nThis Event is included
