BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[SC] U-2 & T-38 Pilot
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261229T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261229T120000
DTSTAMP:20261126T220843Z
UID:hiller-293802@local-events
DESCRIPTION:U-2 & T-38 Pilot \nJohn “Huggy” Huggins\nPresentation\nTu
 esday December 29\, 11AM\n\nAfter retiring from active duty in 2014\, Jon 
 “Huggy” Huggins made history when he became the first civilian instruc
 tor pilot to fly the iconic U-2 solo.  As a civilian Instructor\, Huggins
  helped train the next generation of reconnaissance pilots at Beale Air Fo
 rce Base.  \n\nBeyond his military service\, he is a familiar face throug
 hout the West Coast aviation community as a talented pilot\, mentor\, and 
 popular air show announcer\, known for sharing his passion for aviation wi
 th audiences of all ages.\n\nPresentation is included with Museum admissio
 n.\n\nAges: Family / kids\nSource: https://www.hiller.org/event/u2-t38-pil
 ot/\nLast synced: 2026-11-26 14:08 PST
LOCATION:Hiller Aviation Museum\, 601 Skyway Rd.\, San Carlos
URL:https://www.hiller.org/event/u2-t38-pilot/
END:VEVENT
